    {
      "id": "fl_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -284
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Flocking\n\nThe Simulation node in flocking mode: 300 boids, each steering by the neighbours within `radius` — away from the closest (separation), along with their heading (alignment) and toward their centre (cohesion). The field wraps at its edges.\n\nThe sliders, top to bottom: separation, alignment, cohesion and attract. Drag them to change the flock's character as it flies; raise attract to herd it with the mouse. `colors` gives each boid its own shade of the palette.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Flocking\n\nThe Simulation node in flocking mode: 300 boids, each steering by the neighbours within `radius` — away from the closest (separation), along with their heading (alignment) and toward their centre (cohesion). The field wraps at its edges.\n\nThe sliders, top to bottom: separation, alignment, cohesion and attract. Drag them to change the flock's character as it flies; raise attract to herd it with the mouse. `colors` gives each boid its own shade of the palette.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 220
      }
    },
